{"title": "Marksmanship", "pageid": 28330, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Marksmanship", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Marksmanship</b> is a passive feature that increases the hit chance of ranged attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain a +1 bonus to Ranged <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Thrown</a> Attack Rolls. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Marksmanship_Hat\" title=\"Marksmanship Hat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Marksmanship_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Marksmanship_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Marksmanship_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Marksmanship_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Marksmanship_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Marksmanship_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Marksmanship_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Marksmanship_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Marksmanship_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Marksmanship_Hat\" title=\"Marksmanship Hat\">Marksmanship Hat</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The bonus also applies to spell attack rolls.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Marksmanship only applies to ranged weapons in the main hand, thus <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Crossbow\" title=\"Hand Crossbow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Hand_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Hand_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Hand_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hand_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Hand_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Hand_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Hand_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Hand_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Hand_Crossbow_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Crossbow\" title=\"Hand Crossbow\">Hand Crossbows</a> equipped in the off-hand are unaffected.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201938\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1343/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10863/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3388/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 937647/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.118      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   41.118      1 -total\n 27.82%   11.438      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 24.35%   10.011      2 Template:Item_icon\n 21.56%    8.863     14 Template:Trim\n 21.48%    8.831      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 21.26%    8.741      1 Template:Attack_Roll\n 19.95%    8.202      1 Template:Icon_text\n 19.72%    8.109      5 Template:Ifempty\n 18.77%    7.716      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28330-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201938 and revision id 371919. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}